+  /**
+    * Immediately gets a value from a {@link Supplier} with this context as the
+    * {@link #current} context.
+    *
+    * <p>This API is <a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc-java/pull/12935">experimental</a> and
+    * subject to change.
