   <td rowspan="6" >Retry with exponential backoff and deadline (see <a href="https://grpc.github.io/grpc-java/javadoc/io/grpc/ManagedChannelBuilder.html#enableRetry--">ManagedChannelBuilder#enableRetry()</a>
   </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
